        <mxCell id="gate" parent="1" style="rounded=1;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="mechanism gate — e2e/resource-back-spa.spec.ts (new)&#10;toHaveURL alone is blind: a full reload also lands the URL. The spec pins the mechanism with two independent signals:&#10;1. memory sentinel: window.__spaSentinel = crypto.randomUUID() before the click, read back after — a reload drops the window (undefined)&#10;2. document-request counter: page.on(request), resourceType document, attached after goto — a reload always issues one before the target paints&#10;plus the outcome floor: URL arrives and the landed face marker renders. Faces probed: agent-detail (the reported one) and skills." vertex="1">
